Credential rotation is a finite CLI command, not a daemon.  Do not cancel it
after 100 ms and suppress the resulting exception: that can leave a partial
certificate set and makes the assertion inspect empty captured output.

The generated configuration should still be checked for the upstream
production defaults, but the test daemons must not bind privileged port 443.
Rewrite only the temporary test configurations to use unprivileged ports so
the tests do not require root solely for low-port binding.

